{
 "engine": "kokoro",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "before": 0.4,
 "between": 0.35,
 "after": 0.6,
 "voices": [
  {
   "id": "af_heart",
   "label": "Heart",
   "scenes": [
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "The engine keeps what it knows in small tables.",
       "file": "voice/c6e7db0e14ef84fc.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 2.4
      },
      {
       "text": "This is the table of computers.",
       "file": "voice/72a73bcb9b81c80c.mp3",
       "start": 3.15,
       "length": 1.753
      },
      {
       "text": "Each row is one computer: its number, its name, what you want it to be, and what the engine last saw.",
       "file": "voice/c2a99a24d940a029.mp3",
       "start": 5.253,
       "length": 5.762
      }
     ],
     "total": 11.615
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "You click Start in the app.",
       "file": "voice/8c844def6acfd80d.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 1.243
      },
      {
       "text": "The app starts nothing itself.",
       "file": "voice/c7196315da8e779b.mp3",
       "start": 1.993,
       "length": 1.546
      },
      {
       "text": "It sends a call, start computer seven, into one queue.",
       "file": "voice/3af3bf43f09c90f8.mp3",
       "start": 3.889,
       "length": 2.91
      },
      {
       "text": "Everything that can change the state enters through that queue, one at a time.",
       "file": "voice/820931612518997b.mp3",
       "start": 7.149,
       "length": 3.975
      }
     ],
     "total": 11.724
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "The core is a function.",
       "file": "voice/d76efafab51d8f4b.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 1.158
      },
      {
       "text": "It reads the state and the call, and checks that computer seven exists and is stopped.",
       "file": "voice/c7c07fa5d69df2a4.mp3",
       "start": 1.908,
       "length": 4.62
      },
      {
       "text": "Then it returns three things: the new state, an event, and an effect.",
       "file": "voice/ad0933722d0150d1.mp3",
       "start": 6.878,
       "length": 3.603
      }
     ],
     "total": 11.081
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "The effect is only a request.",
       "file": "voice/85811c5b0fc376a4.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 1.631
      },
      {
       "text": "A driver does the real work: it starts the virtual machine.",
       "file": "voice/ce88df913b63a6e0.mp3",
       "start": 2.381,
       "length": 3.248
      },
      {
       "text": "That takes time, and it can fail.",
       "file": "voice/8a397508b6562165.mp3",
       "start": 5.979,
       "length": 1.762
      },
      {
       "text": "When it is done, its answer comes back through the same queue, as an input.",
       "file": "voice/af9e1066d148c630.mp3",
       "start": 8.091,
       "length": 3.893
      }
     ],
     "total": 12.584
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "The core handles that input the same way.",
       "file": "voice/e3789ea7e085b6fa.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 2.039
      },
      {
       "text": "It writes seen running, and a second event.",
       "file": "voice/86f53c25789de687.mp3",
       "start": 2.789,
       "length": 2.203
      },
      {
       "text": "What you want and what the engine saw now agree, so there is nothing left to do.",
       "file": "voice/10b1257e644c58fa.mp3",
       "start": 5.342,
       "length": 4.153
      }
     ],
     "total": 10.095
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "The core touches nothing.",
       "file": "voice/bfc7a4dfb453931c.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 1.229
      },
      {
       "text": "So the same inputs, in the same order, always give the same result: the engine can replay a history, and pick up after a crash.",
       "file": "voice/b14f967da2265528.mp3",
       "start": 1.979,
       "length": 7.755
      },
      {
       "text": "The numbered events are how the app follows what the engine did.",
       "file": "voice/74c4f5cceec6911c.mp3",
       "start": 10.084,
       "length": 3.083
      },
      {
       "text": "What agents do inside a computer is not in them: that is the record, and it is written apart.",
       "file": "voice/f92799117c540c95.mp3",
       "start": 13.517,
       "length": 5.386
      },
      {
       "text": "And the core can be tested with millions of random sequences of inputs before it ever starts a real machine.",
       "file": "voice/a2eb91cb61c02653.mp3",
       "start": 19.253,
       "length": 6.378
      }
     ],
     "total": 26.231
    }
   ],
   "total": 83.33
  }
 ]
}
